{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_document", "label": "Repository Status and Open Decisions", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reviewed on 9 October 2026 from files in this backend repository. The mysql command was not on PATH and vendor was not installed, so the live Fito database was not inspected. The result is file status only."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_laravel_skeleton", "label": "Laravel 12 Skeleton", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This backend is a Laravel 12 skeleton. composer.json has only laravel/framework and laravel/tinker. Migrations are the default users, cache, and jobs set. Routes are web.php and console.php and return the Laravel welcome page. The only feature test is HTTP 200 on the home page. .env.example has no product settings beyond Laravel defaults. The local .env names a MySQL connection to a database called Fito. No old product document was found in the repo, and no old ban on designing the whole product was found, which is why this design is not limited to OTP."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_user_model", "label": "App Models User", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only product model is App\\Models\\User with name, email, and password. Reported minimal signup does not match the repository: users.password is required, uniqueness is on email, only the web session guard exists, and Sanctum and routes/api.php are absent."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_signup_report_conflict", "label": "Signup Report Conflict", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An important conflict: a report that minimal signup was implemented does not match the repository. The file status, not that report, is the basis for what must be built."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_preserved_stack", "label": "Preserved Stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keep Laravel 12, PHP 8.2, MySQL as the target engine, PHPUnit, and in-memory SQLite for tests. Keep sessions, cache, cache_locks, jobs, job_batches, and failed_jobs. Keep the migration and Eloquent pattern. If the initial users migration has already run, F01 does not rewrite history; the change is a new migration."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_f01_corrections", "label": "F01 Corrections to the Skeleton", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When F01 starts: change users from email and password to phone and national code, remove the product dependency on password_reset_tokens, replace the seeder that creates test@example.com, add API v1, a token guard, and an access policy, and lock production against the fixed OTP."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d01", "label": "D-01 Coach Profile Scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed. coach_profiles is the ownership boundary. Workspace is only the name of that coach's AI memory, not a gym entity. There is no gym."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d02", "label": "D-02 Rial or Toman", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Proposal: store money and charge the gateway in integer rial. If the sales UI shows toman, convert only at that edge with a factor of 10. Amounts must not be decimal or ambiguous, and Iranian gateways usually take rial. Five million toman and five million rial differ by ten times. Columns are named *_irr. If rejected, money column names and units change before F02. Order logic does not fundamentally change."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d03", "label": "D-03 Access After the Relationship Ends", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed, and narrower than the previous proposal. Messages, progress, and programs of that period remain for the coach. Photos close after the end. There is no access outside the contract interval."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d04", "label": "D-04 Expiry and Excess Capacity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Proposal: expiry closes new writes. Lower capacity does not automatically end active relationships; invitations and reactivation are rejected until the count fits. No proration and no automatic bank renewal. Automatic cutoff is a heavy commercial decision and is not in the product definition. A new paused status is not added to the relationship. If rejected, the status and the order of choosing excess athletes must be specified before F03."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d05", "label": "D-05 Analysis Visibility Across Coaches", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Proposal: an observation is either private to the athlete or attached to one relationship. A second coach does not see it automatically. The product asked to separate personal data from relationship data and allows several coaches. The effect is a visibility column on body_observations. If rejected, the observation rule must be simplified before F08, and the visibility column might be removed."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d06", "label": "D-06 Coach Approves AI Output", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Proposal: AI output is not assigned until the coach approves it. Athlete access to the assistant defaults off and depends on a plan capability. That quota is also taken from the coach's period. The product left these open, and the first version should be conservative and implementable. The effect is ai_generations statuses and the ai_athlete_access key. If rejected, F10 changes the publish path or the conversation audience, and that should be said before that stage."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d07", "label": "D-07 Exercise and Food Catalogs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmed for exercises: a platform bank plus private exercises, and an admin-approved request to enter the bank. Private food is still a technical proposal of the same pattern and has not been separately rejected."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d08", "label": "D-08 Real Gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The payment model should not depend on a gateway name. Until a gateway and merchant are chosen, F02 builds the domain path, idempotent callback, and a test gateway. The real connection is not that stage. Missing a gateway name does not stop the table design."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_technical_choices", "label": "Non-Blocking Technical Choices", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "These are not commercial decisions and can be reversed during implementation: Laravel Sanctum for mobile tokens and web cookie sessions, the /api/v1 prefix, nullable columns for conditional unique keys because tests use SQLite, textual coach-knowledge retrieval without a vector database, selling AI as a request count while recording tokens only for cost, civil timezone Asia/Tehran with instants stored in UTC, OTP valid 120 seconds with five attempts and invitations valid 7 days, and versioned formulas bmi_v1 and epley_v1."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_out_of_roadmap", "label": "Outside the Roadmap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actual food intake, athlete payment to the platform, independent athlete service entry, choosing a coach from a public list, an AI program without a coach, settlement, a marketplace, realtime chat, and gym management have no stage id. Body photos are no longer outside the map."}, {"id": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_body_photos_in_scope", "label": "Body Photos Are in Scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Body photos are no longer outside the roadmap. They are stored in this version, with coach and AI access only during the active relationship."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_product_readme_proposal", "target": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d02", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_product_readme_proposal", "target": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d04", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_product_readme_proposal", "target": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d05", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_product_readme_proposal", "target": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d06", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/product/05-current-state-and-decisions.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_product_readme_proposal", "target": "docs_product_05_current_state_and_decisions_d08", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_